{
  "slug": "bettercallclaude",
  "name": "Bettercallclaude",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Swiss Legal Intelligence for Claude Cowork. 20 agents, 19 commands, 14 skills, and 9 MCP servers covering BGE/ATF/DTF precedent research, litigation strategy, document drafting, and citation verification — in DE/FR/IT/EN, across all 26 Swiss cantons.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **21 agents**, **27 commands**, **1 hook** and **9 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `adversarial-analysis` (Adversarial stress test — three agents (Advocate FOR, Adversary AGAINST, Judicial synthesis with probability)), `citation-content-verify` (Substantive citation verifier — checks every citation in a draft against the live source for existence AND content…), `compliance-frameworks` (Swiss financial regulatory compliance — FINMA, GwG/AML/KYC, FIDLEG/FINIG licensing, BankG, crypto/DLT regulation, cross-border obligations (AEOI/CRS, FATCA)), `data-protection-law` (Swiss data protection — nDSG/FADP framework, GDPR adequacy, cantonal DP laws (IDG/KDSG/LIPAD), DSFA/DPIA, cross-border transfers), `legal-5step-framework` (End-to-end 5-step Swiss legal pipeline: (1) intake/fact extraction, (2) BGE/statute research, (3) strategy/risk assessment, (4) adversarial stress test,…), `legal-chronology` (Legal chronology builder — turns case documents (contracts, correspondence, court filings, expert reports) into a sourced legal timeline), `legal-evaluator` (Verdict engine — judges artifacts against a Goal Record using MCP verification tools), `legal-intake` (Swiss legal intake — transforms vague or complex queries into actionable execution plans), and 8 more\n- **Agents** (21): `adversary` (Challenges a legal position by finding weaknesses, counter-precedents, and opposing arguments under Swiss law), `advocate` (Builds the strongest possible case in favor of a legal position using Swiss law precedents, statutory provisions, and…), `briefing` (Pre-execution briefing session that collects case context through multi-agent panel consultation, builds a structured execution plan, and persists…), `cantonal` (Analyzes law across all 26 Swiss cantons including cantonal constitutions, court systems, intercantonal concordats, procedural variations, and multi-canton…), `chronology-builder` (Isolated worker that reads case documents iteratively and extracts sourced timeline events (date, neutral fact, mandatory document+locus provenance,…), `citation` (Verifies, formats, and converts Swiss legal citations across BGE/ATF/DTF, cantonal decisions, and statutory references in DE/FR/IT), `compliance` (Assesses regulatory compliance across FINMA, GwG/LBA (AML), FIDLEG/FINIG, and Swiss financial market regulations with gap analysis and remediation…), `corporate` (Advises on Swiss corporate structures (AG/SA, GmbH/Sarl), M&A transactions, corporate governance, shareholder agreements, and commercial contracts under OR…), and 13 more\n- **Commands** (27): `adversarial` (Run three-agent adversarial analysis -- advocate builds the case, adversary challenges it, judicial analyst synthesizes), `briefing` (Structured pre-execution briefing session -- collects case context through specialist panel, builds execution plan, supports resume and depth…), `cantonal` (Analyze cantonal law for all 26 Swiss cantons -- cantonal court decisions, cantonal legislation, procedural specifics, and interaction…), `cite` (Validate, format, and look up Swiss legal citations including BGE/ATF/DTF decisions and statutory references), `doc-analyze` (Analyze Swiss legal documents -- identify legal issues, extract key clauses, verify citations, and assess compliance), `doctor` (Diagnose MCP server connectivity — tests each server, reports status and impact in plain language, suggests fixes for…), `draft` (Draft Swiss legal documents including contracts (OR), court submissions (ZPO), and legal opinions (Gutachten) with multi-lingual support), `federal` (Force Federal Law Mode for Swiss federal legal analysis, overriding cantonal auto-detection), and 19 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (9): `entscheidsuche`, `bge-search`, `legal-citations`, `fedlex-sparql`, `onlinekommentar`, `legal-persona`, `tas-jurisprudence`, `swiss-caselaw`, and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install bettercallclaude@claude-community` from `fedec65/bettercallclaude` (`bettercallclaude`).",
